-- a measurement with an identity of its own: the event that produced it, beside the report. Without
-- this the record identifies the number and not the measuring, so one event cited in two papers
-- enters an aggregate twice — which is what the ChEMBL analysis found in 90% of the pairs it had to
-- discard before it could estimate the experimental uncertainty at all.
Measured : Type 0 → Type 1
Measured V = Nat × Report V
